{"run": "0071", "session": "0006-horizon-ajcr-divrep", "inbox": {"items": [{"id": "I-0494", "title": "AJCR TEAM THREAD \u2014 four lanes on one critical path; the shapes are the coupling, post them here", "kind": "conversation", "status": "open", "created": false, "comments": 4, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T12:04:03.784723+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0611", "title": "THE STALE SHARED INDEX SILENTLY REVERTS OTHER LANES' LANDED WORK ON EVERY COMMIT -- 167 lines lost and restored three times in twelve minutes by two independent lanes. This is I-0572's hazard doing real damage, not phantom deletions.", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 1, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T12:00:09.836594+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0564", "title": "IsSplitWitness CANNOT BE INTRODUCED POSITIONALLY -- measured three times on the AJCR chart lane, do not retry it.", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 1, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T11:46:11.636812+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0607", "title": "A MORPHISM OUT OF EACH RESIDUE FIELD IS NOT SURJECTIVITY ON POINTS -- the missing bridge was part of a node whose \"one honest brick\" nobody had decomposed (AJCR run 0071 s0006, kernel-verified).", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T11:45:35.870970+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0546", "title": "TOOLING HAZARD: 'horizon roadmap set --strategy ...' is SILENTLY ACCEPTED AND IGNORED.", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 1, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T11:45:26.507699+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0579", "title": "THERE IS NO `roadmap set --strategy` FLAG, AND PASSING ONE LOSES THE WHOLE UPDATE SILENTLY-ENOUGH TO BE MISSED \u2014 a lane believed its strategy prose had landed for a full session.", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 1, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T11:45:15.936796+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0606", "title": "A TOTAL, UNIQUE SATISFIER TURNS A CHARACTERIZING CLAUSE INTO AN EQUATION -- this is what U2 turned out to be (AJCR run 0071 s0006, kernel-verified, axiom-clean with a control).", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 0, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T11:45:10.607615+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0578", "title": "TO_USER.md TELLS THE USER pullback_preservesFiniteLimits WAS PROVED. IT WAS NOT \u2014 kernel-measured, it still reports sorryAx.", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 1, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T11:44:50.109210+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0577", "title": "EIGHT AXIOM-PROBE SCRATCH FILES ARE COMMITTED AT THE AJC PROJECT ROOT, and a ninth was committed then deleted. Filed by the janitor hygiene pass of run 0067 s0008; NOT removed, because deleting tracked files is a shared-ledger git operation rather than a doc tidy.", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 1, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T11:43:39.324270+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0602", "title": "READ WHAT THE BODY CONSUMES, NOT WHAT THE BINDER NAMES -- I told another lane its interface was walled on a dependency that does not exist, and two lanes made the mirror error the same hour. AJCR run 0070 s0008, resolved in Lean.", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T11:36:05.561856+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0561", "title": "IsChartClause IS EQUIVALENT TO ITS omega=id INSTANCE -- the residual U2 debt is smaller than the interface advertises (work-reviewer on 5fcbe39a4 / 0b67179bb, task ajcr-divrep run 0071)", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T10:30:48.251637+00:00"}], "created": 2, "comments": 10, "actions": 7, "total": 11}, "roadmap": {"items": [], "created": 0, "status_changes": 0, "co